<title>UK: BOE invites band 1,2 bills, shortage 1.4 bln stg.</title>
<headline>BOE invites band 1,2 bills, shortage 1.4 bln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England invited UK money market operators to offer band 1 and 2 bills in exchange for cash and offered an unrestricted bill/FRG repo to January 6 to help alleviate a forecast 1.4 billion stg liquidity shortage in the market.</p>
<p>The forecast was revised from the previous estimate of 1.25 billion stg.</p>
</text>
